      <div type="clause" n="52">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 52</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XCVI} Se ðe diernum geðingum betygen sie, geswicne hine be CXX hida þara geðingea oððe CXX sciƚƚ geselle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">He who is accused of [making] secret compacts, let him clear himself of [the accusation of making] those compacts by [an oath of the value of] 120 hides, or let him pay 120 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">He who is accused of making an illicit compact shall clear himself from the charge with [an oath worth] 120 hides, or pay 120 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Se ðe dyrnum geðingum betogen sy, geladie hine be CXX hida ðara geþinga oþþe CXX scll' gesylle.</ab>
      </div>
